    "goal_index": "7",
    "text": "Does it tie? Watch Domain’s washes in C5 rise to 360 and its bonus in I5 step up to $150.",
    "teach": "",
    "why": "",
    "hint_stuck": "pulse cell I5 · The first test that holds wins."
